OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland's future hangs in the
OL,4,Abalance as chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FGordon Brothers bought Poundland, which
OL,7,Fhad been struggling, from the Polish
OL,8,Fretail group Pepco in June last year
OL,9,Ffor a nominal #1.
